{"seq":3,"slug":"task-caching-remote","title":"任务缓存与远程缓存：本地缓存、Vercel Remote Cache 与 Nx Cloud","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/build-orchestration/task-caching-remote","wordCount":1306,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"任务缓存与远程缓存-本地缓存-vercel-remote-cache-与-nx-cloud\">任务缓存与远程缓存：本地缓存、Vercel Remote Cache 与 Nx Cloud</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>任务缓存</td>\n<td>若任务输入未变化，直接复用上次输出、跳过实际执行的机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cache Key（Hash）</td>\n<td>由文件内容、依赖包 hash、环境变量等因子共同计算的缓存唯一标识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cache HIT</td>\n<td>查询到匹配的缓存记录，直接恢复输出并重放日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cache MISS</td>\n<td>未找到匹配缓存，需实际执行任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Remote Cache</td>\n<td>将本地缓存上传到云端存储，供 CI 和团队成员之间共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布式任务执行（DTE）</td>\n<td>Nx Cloud 的能力，将任务分发到多台 CI 机器并行执行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"任务缓存的核心原理\">任务缓存的核心原理</h2><p>任务缓存（Task Caching）是 Monorepo 构建加速的最核心机制。其基本思想是：<strong>如果一个任务的所有输入（inputs）没有变化，则直接复用上次执行的输出（outputs），跳过实际执行</strong>。</p>\n<p>这个看似简单的机制，在大型 Monorepo 中可以将 CI 时间从数十分钟压缩到几分钟。</p>\n<h3 id=\"缓存命中的完整生命周期\">缓存命中的完整生命周期</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[触发任务执行] --&gt; B[计算输入 Hash]&#10;    B --&gt; C{查询缓存}&#10;    C -- Cache HIT --&gt; D[从缓存恢复 outputs]&#10;    C -- Cache MISS --&gt; E[实际执行任务]&#10;    D --&gt; F[输出到 stdout(重放日志)]&#10;    E --&gt; G[存储 outputs 到缓存]&#10;    G --&gt; H[完成任务]&#10;    F --&gt; H\">graph TD\n    A[触发任务执行] --&gt; B[计算输入 Hash]\n    B --&gt; C{查询缓存}\n    C -- Cache HIT --&gt; D[从缓存恢复 outputs]\n    C -- Cache MISS --&gt; E[实际执行任务]\n    D --&gt; F[输出到 stdout(重放日志)]\n    E --&gt; G[存储 outputs 到缓存]\n    G --&gt; H[完成任务]\n    F --&gt; H</pre><p>缓存命中时，Turborepo 和 Nx 都会<strong>重放</strong>上次任务的 stdout 日志，使 CI 日志看起来与实际执行相同，不会产生&quot;为何没有输出&quot;的困惑。</p>\n<h3 id=\"hash-输入的完整因子\">Hash 输入的完整因子</h3><p>一个任务的缓存 key 由以下因子共同决定：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因子类型</th>\n<th>Turborepo</th>\n<th>Nx</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>源码文件</td>\n<td>inputs glob（配置的或默认 git-tracked）</td>\n<td>namedInputs（default/production）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>package.json</td>\n<td>包含在文件 hash 中</td>\n<td>包含在文件 hash 中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖包 hash</td>\n<td>dependsOn ^task 的输出 hash</td>\n<td>dependsOn ^task 的输出 hash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境变量</td>\n<td>pipeline <code>env</code> 字段</td>\n<td>targetDefaults <code>env</code> 字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建工具配置</td>\n<td>turbo.json</td>\n<td>nx.json + project.json</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turborepo/Nx 版本</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"本地缓存机制\">本地缓存机制</h2><h3 id=\"turborepo-本地缓存\">Turborepo 本地缓存</h3><p><strong>存储位置</strong>：项目根目录 <code>node_modules/.cache/turbo/</code>（可通过 <code>--cache-dir</code> 自定义）</p>\n<p><strong>缓存结构</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"node_modules/.cache/turbo/&#10;└── {task-hash}/&#10;    ├── turbo-meta.json        # 元数据（duration, exitCode, etc.）&#10;    ├── .turbo/&#10;    │   └── turbo-build.log    # 任务执行日志&#10;    └── dist/                  # outputs 的快照（按配置路径）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>node_modules/.cache/turbo/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── {task-hash}/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── turbo-meta.json        # 元数据（duration, exitCode, etc.）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── .turbo/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   └── turbo-build.log    # 任务执行日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── dist/                  # outputs 的快照（按配置路径）</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>缓存操作命令</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 清除所有本地缓存&#10;turbo clean&#10;&#10;# 强制重新执行（不读缓存，但写缓存）&#10;turbo build --force&#10;&#10;# 不写缓存运行&#10;turbo build --no-cache\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 清除所有本地缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clean</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 强制重新执行（不读缓存，但写缓存）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --force</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 不写缓存运行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --no-cache</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"nx-本地缓存\">Nx 本地缓存</h3><p><strong>存储位置</strong>：<code>.nx/cache/</code>（项目根目录，推荐加入 <code>.gitignore</code>）</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看缓存统计&#10;nx reset                    # 清除缓存&#10;nx build web --skip-nx-cache  # 跳过缓存\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看缓存统计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> reset</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    # 清除缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> web</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --skip-nx-cache</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 跳过缓存</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>.nx/cache/</code> 目录结构与 Turborepo 类似，以 hash 为目录名存储任务产物。</p>\n<h3 id=\"本地缓存的价值场景\">本地缓存的价值场景</h3><p>本地缓存主要价值在于<strong>开发时的反复切换场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在多个 feature branch 之间切换，切回旧分支后 build 直接命中缓存</li>\n<li><code>git stash</code> 后恢复工作，未变更包的任务从缓存恢复</li>\n<li>运行 <code>pnpm install</code> 后（仅 lockfile 变更），未受影响包的任务仍命中缓存</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"vercel-remote-cache\">Vercel Remote Cache</h2><p>Vercel Remote Cache 是 Turborepo 的官方远程缓存服务，使用 Vercel 平台的对象存储。</p>\n<h3 id=\"配置步骤\">配置步骤</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Step 1: 安装 Turbo CLI（全局）&#10;npm i -g turbo&#10;&#10;# Step 2: 登录 Vercel（浏览器授权）&#10;turbo login&#10;&#10;# Step 3: 关联仓库到 Vercel 团队&#10;turbo link&#10;# 选择团队后，会在根目录生成 .turbo/config.json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Step 1: 安装 Turbo CLI（全局）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -g</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> turbo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Step 2: 登录 Vercel（浏览器授权）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Step 3: 关联仓库到 Vercel 团队</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> link</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 选择团队后，会在根目录生成 .turbo/config.json</span></span></code></pre></div><p>生成的 <code>.turbo/config.json</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;teamid&quot;: &quot;team_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx&quot;,&#10;  &quot;apiurl&quot;: &quot;https://api.vercel.com&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"teamid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"team_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"apiurl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.vercel.com\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ci-环境配置\">CI 环境配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 在 CI 中设置环境变量（不运行 turbo login）&#10;TURBO_TOKEN=xxxxxxxxxx     # 从 vercel.com/account/tokens 获取&#10;TURBO_TEAM=team_xxxx       # 团队 ID 或团队 slug\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在 CI 中设置环境变量（不运行 turbo login）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TURBO_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">xxxxxxxxxx</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     # 从 vercel.com/account/tokens 获取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TURBO_TEAM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">team_xxxx</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 团队 ID 或团队 slug</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Turborepo 会自动从这两个环境变量读取配置，无需 <code>.turbo/config.json</code>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"缓存命中率分析\">缓存命中率分析</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看缓存命中率统计（在 Vercel Dashboard 的 Remote Cache 页面）&#10;turbo build --summarize    # 生成 .turbo/runs/{run-id}/summary.json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看缓存命中率统计（在 Vercel Dashboard 的 Remote Cache 页面）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --summarize</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 生成 .turbo/runs/{run-id}/summary.json</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>summary.json</code> 包含详细的任务执行数据，可以分析缓存命中率和潜在优化空间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"nx-cloud\">Nx Cloud</h2><p>Nx Cloud 是 Nx 的官方远程缓存和分布式任务执行服务，提供比 Vercel Remote Cache 更丰富的企业级能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"配置步骤\">配置步骤</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 方式一：新建工作空间时选择 Nx Cloud（推荐）&#10;npx create-nx-workspace@latest --nxCloud=yes&#10;&#10;# 方式二：为已有工作空间添加 Nx Cloud&#10;nx connect\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 方式一：新建工作空间时选择 Nx Cloud（推荐）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create-nx-workspace@latest</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --nxCloud=yes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 方式二：为已有工作空间添加 Nx Cloud</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> connect</span></span></code></pre></div><p>连接后，<code>nx.json</code> 中会添加 <code>nxCloudId</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;nxCloudId&quot;: &quot;xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"nxCloudId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"nx-cloud-的分布式任务执行-dte\">Nx Cloud 的分布式任务执行（DTE）</h3><p>Nx Cloud 除了缓存功能外，还提供<strong>分布式任务执行（Distributed Task Execution）</strong>，能将任务分发到多台 CI 机器并行执行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/ci.yml&#10;jobs:&#10;  agents:&#10;    name: Nx Cloud Agent ${{ matrix.agent }}&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    strategy:&#10;      matrix:&#10;        agent: [1, 2, 3]&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - name: Start Nx Cloud Agent&#10;        run: npx nx-cloud start-agent&#10;        env:&#10;          NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN }}&#10;&#10;  main:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    needs: []&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          fetch-depth: 0&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - name: Initialize Nx Cloud CI Run&#10;        run: npx nx-cloud start-ci-run --distribute-on=&quot;3 linux-medium-js&quot;&#10;        env:&#10;          NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN }}&#10;      - run: nx affected -t build test lint --base=origin/main&#10;      - name: Stop Nx Cloud Agents&#10;        if: always()&#10;        run: npx nx-cloud stop-all-agents\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/ci.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  agents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Nx Cloud Agent ${{ matrix.agent }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    strategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      matrix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        agent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Start Nx Cloud Agent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx nx-cloud start-agent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    needs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          fetch-depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Initialize Nx Cloud CI Run</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx nx-cloud start-ci-run --distribute-on=\"3 linux-medium-js\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">nx affected -t build test lint --base=origin/main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Stop Nx Cloud Agents</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">always()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx nx-cloud stop-all-agents</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"各方案横向对比\">各方案横向对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Turborepo 本地</th>\n<th>Vercel Remote Cache</th>\n<th>Nx 本地</th>\n<th>Nx Cloud</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>团队间共享缓存</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布式任务执行</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是（DTE）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI 缓存命中率统计</td>\n<td>基础</td>\n<td>仪表盘</td>\n<td>基础</td>\n<td>完整分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用工具</td>\n<td>Turborepo</td>\n<td>Turborepo</td>\n<td>Nx</td>\n<td>Nx</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定价</td>\n<td>免费（存储限制）</td>\n<td>按存储/带宽计费</td>\n<td>免费</td>\n<td>免费套餐+企业版</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自建支持</td>\n<td>是（兼容API）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"自建-remote-cache-方案\">自建 Remote Cache 方案</h2><p>对于有数据主权要求或无法使用云服务的企业，可以自建 Remote Cache 服务器。</p>\n<h3 id=\"turborepo-兼容服务器\">Turborepo 兼容服务器</h3><p>开源项目 <code>ducktors/turborepo-remote-cache</code> 实现了 Turborepo 的 Remote Cache API：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# docker-compose.yml&#10;version: &#39;3.8&#39;&#10;services:&#10;  turbo-cache:&#10;    image: ducktors/turborepo-remote-cache:latest&#10;    ports:&#10;      - &#39;3000:3000&#39;&#10;    environment:&#10;      NODE_ENV: production&#10;      TURBO_TOKEN: your-secret-token&#10;      STORAGE_PROVIDER: s3&#10;      S3_ACCESS_KEY: your-s3-access-key&#10;      S3_SECRET_KEY: your-s3-secret-key&#10;      S3_BUCKET: turbo-cache-bucket&#10;      S3_ENDPOINT: https://s3.amazonaws.com\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># docker-compose.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3.8'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  turbo-cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ducktors/turborepo-remote-cache:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3000:3000'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      NODE_ENV</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      TURBO_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">your-secret-token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      STORAGE_PROVIDER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">s3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      S3_ACCESS_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">your-s3-access-key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      S3_SECRET_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">your-s3-secret-key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      S3_BUCKET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">turbo-cache-bucket</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      S3_ENDPOINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://s3.amazonaws.com</span></span></code></pre></div><p>支持多种存储后端：Local、S3、GCS、Azure Blob、Cloudflare R2。</p>\n<h3 id=\"缓存策略配置建议\">缓存策略配置建议</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开源项目/个人项目</td>\n<td>仅本地缓存（零成本）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小团队（&lt;10人）Monorepo</td>\n<td>Vercel Remote Cache（免费套餐）或自建 S3 方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中型团队（10-50人）</td>\n<td>Vercel Remote Cache 付费版或 Nx Cloud 免费套餐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大型团队（50+人）</td>\n<td>Nx Cloud 企业版（DTE 价值显著）或自建 S3 方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有合规要求的企业</td>\n<td>自建 S3/MinIO 方案，数据不离内网</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>任务缓存是 Monorepo 规模化的最重要基础设施，理解其工作原理才能正确配置并充分发挥价值：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>缓存命中的前提是 hash 一致</strong>：理解 hash 输入（文件 + 环境变量 + 工具版本）是优化缓存命中率的基础</li>\n<li><strong>精细化 inputs/outputs 配置</strong>：排除无关文件，避免 hash 被不必要的文件变更失效</li>\n<li><strong>Remote Cache 是团队级缓存的关键</strong>：没有 remote cache，每个 CI runner 都需要重新构建</li>\n<li><strong>有副作用的任务必须 <code>cache: false</code></strong>：部署、DB 迁移等不应被缓存恢复</li>\n<li><strong>选型应基于实际规模</strong>：中小型团队 Vercel Remote Cache 足够；超大型团队或合规需求时考虑自建或 Nx Cloud DTE</li>\n<li><strong>本地缓存对 branch 切换场景价值显著</strong>：配合 git stash 的工作流，缓存命中率通常在 80% 以上</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>本章节相关文档：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"turborepo-engineering\">Turborepo 工程实践</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"nx-workspace\">Nx 工作空间</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"任务缓存与远程缓存：本地缓存、Vercel Remote Cache 与 Nx Cloud","id":"任务缓存与远程缓存-本地缓存-vercel-remote-cache-与-nx-cloud"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"任务缓存的核心原理","id":"任务缓存的核心原理"},{"level":3,"text":"缓存命中的完整生命周期","id":"缓存命中的完整生命周期"},{"level":3,"text":"Hash 输入的完整因子","id":"hash-输入的完整因子"},{"level":2,"text":"本地缓存机制","id":"本地缓存机制"},{"level":3,"text":"Turborepo 本地缓存","id":"turborepo-本地缓存"},{"level":3,"text":"Nx 本地缓存","id":"nx-本地缓存"},{"level":3,"text":"本地缓存的价值场景","id":"本地缓存的价值场景"},{"level":2,"text":"Vercel Remote Cache","id":"vercel-remote-cache"},{"level":3,"text":"配置步骤","id":"配置步骤"},{"level":3,"text":"CI 环境配置","id":"ci-环境配置"},{"level":3,"text":"缓存命中率分析","id":"缓存命中率分析"},{"level":2,"text":"Nx Cloud","id":"nx-cloud"},{"level":3,"text":"配置步骤","id":"配置步骤"},{"level":3,"text":"Nx Cloud 的分布式任务执行（DTE）","id":"nx-cloud-的分布式任务执行-dte"},{"level":3,"text":"各方案横向对比","id":"各方案横向对比"},{"level":2,"text":"自建 Remote Cache 方案","id":"自建-remote-cache-方案"},{"level":3,"text":"Turborepo 兼容服务器","id":"turborepo-兼容服务器"},{"level":3,"text":"缓存策略配置建议","id":"缓存策略配置建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Nx 工作空间：项目图、受影响分析与 generators","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/build-orchestration/nx-workspace"},"next":{"title":"共享配置与约定：ESLint/TSConfig/Prettier 跨包统一","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/code-quality/shared-config-conventions"}}